---
canonical:
  title: The Canterbury Tales, The Franklin’s Tale, 767–770
  author: Geoffrey Chaucer
  language: enm
  source: "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/22120"
  text: |
    Love is a thing as any spirit free;
    Wommen of kinde desiren libertee,
    And nat to ben constreyned as a thral;
    And so don men, if I soth seyen shal.
